    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded on a remote island, your only path to escape leads through a dangerous underground dungeon. <i>Dungeon Rummage - Survival</i> is a turn-based dungeon crawler where you gather resources and upgrade your camp to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the depths to collect essential materials. Bring your finds back to camp to enhance your stats, craft potions, and cook meals, all of which are crucial for facing tougher enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ultimate goal is to reach the dungeon\u2019s bottom and find your way back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feature breakdown:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dungeon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIght enemies in turn based combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use ingredients to cook food or brew potions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use materials to upgrade your camp</p>",
